{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "794f9e44bb167ebd281b8df56b8d923773541c0fbec1ca6ee98bc7d7db106c0a", "ja": "胸躍らせながら、空にだって", "zh": "心潮澎湃，哪怕是飞上天空", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a6c3bb7a7584e6c88b063dad45ffc68e498755141e81c18b9cb4cbe733f611e7", "ja": "こけら落とし公演前にライブイベントへの\n出演を決めたTeam7th。負担を心配する\nプロデューサーに麗花は語る。不安だけど\nときめく毎日を駆け抜けたい。これからも\nその手伝いを。プロデューサーは頷く。", "zh": "在揭幕公演前决定出演现场活动的Team7th。丽花向担心负担过重的制作人说道。虽然心里不安，但还是想奔跑着度过每一天，追逐心动。今后也请继续帮助我。制作人点了点头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1000_null", "source_sha256": "21ee08c23c6be00659bb1d2ffb27662aeffde2852de07ae9c6f07ca2701cf553", "ja": "ライブイベントについての打ち合わせ中……", "zh": "正在商讨现场演出活动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "fc41ff25d3bbcf1de15b9166b9f14658bdd88b652d9d501c65c6b38332c73770", "ja": "……というわけで、レッスンはこの予定で行こうと\n思ってる。合宿の準備ともども、大丈夫そうかな？", "zh": "……所以，课程就按这个安排进行吧。和集训的准备一起，应该没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "2376d588eeda58bb6948517bf745273609bf6b0867a752a2a558cc4c5cf06f95", "ja": "はい、着替えもパジャマも歯ブラシも、\nアイマスクの準備もバッチリです♪", "zh": "好的，换洗衣物、睡衣、牙刷，还有眼罩，全都准备得妥妥的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "440bfbc7402503b2da9bc129ba480be5fc90a3faa1a9e2c41dd405fbfe1337df", "ja": "アイマスク？　なるほど、そこまで気が回ってるなら、\n確かに準備はバッチリかもな。", "zh": "眼罩？原来如此，连这种地方都考虑到了，那确实准备得很充分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "2367d930b620e1c5b24889a6e5e4a46727ec3925cb50de071e001207fe0b4870", "ja": "急に仕事が入った影響で、合宿メニューも\n変わることになったから、結構心配だったんだ。", "zh": "因为临时接了工作，合宿的安排\n也跟着变了，所以我原本还挺担心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "d4f92843d0140ee1bb19c200ef3b29fbfb0712a3378b95955e37c58a7a1d9489", "ja": "そうなんですか？\nありがとうございます♪", "zh": "是这样啊？\n谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "8c955edfb9ba8fbb26223afe0e0e043a31d3c732b3ab0bdd0dfdeb1abd38b74a", "ja": "え？　ありがとうって、何が？", "zh": "诶？谢什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "d20112786512925b92f78d12eb3d09e6b335b4b8ab5eaf7e456ef84e01d02621", "ja": "私たちのこと、たくさん心配してくれてたって\nことですから。そのお礼です♪", "zh": "因为您一直很担心我们嘛。这是表示感谢的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "08da9c0d6e9724ebb55d09eff87164866175efa2c561cd5d47808e8edc3781fd", "ja": "でもでも、新しいお仕事が決まって、\nみんな本当に喜んでますから、大丈夫ですよ！", "zh": "不过不过，因为新工作已经定下来了，大家都真的很开心，所以没关系哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "2b795110edaf64f38c830d3d8e8c75747df362f86e38f80b350003a7a264f7c0", "ja": "そっか……。\nうん、ならいいんだ。", "zh": "这样啊……\n嗯，那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "4ad9d82b98194ddffdafb48f04632810c9c1c29b9da6138f690003a3a97d992d", "ja": "……。もしかして、プロデューサーさんが\n大丈夫じゃなかったりしますか？", "zh": "……莫非，其实是制作人先生\n状态不太好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "598a4982061a3d9711cfd97964c564a8c7d9138a9f10979bcdb9722f431929d8", "ja": "い、いや、そんなことは……！\nうん、まあ、実はちょっとだけ。", "zh": "没、没有，怎么会……！\n好吧，其实确实有一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "e310cce789733b613804e9b3036962ad8be798617fd1647795a4a551ec076ffc", "ja": "みんなの負担が増えるのは、間違いないから。\nこの時期で本当に正しかったのか、つい考えちゃって。", "zh": "因为大家的负担肯定会加重。\n所以忍不住会去想，选在这个时期真的对吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "c3f99b0a0546dfa974cd31e2e6435a09402b67b2452cd4b59c15cc910fe638f4", "ja": "大変！　じゃあ、ぎゅーってします？\n大丈夫だよの、ぎゅーって！", "zh": "大事不好！那要抱抱吗？\n“没事的哦”的抱抱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "f03354b391c5020f9ff6c3b22aa574e21c461a1c1b9af1c91aeef44779603ef2", "ja": "いや大丈夫、大丈夫だから！　……その、ありがとう。\nうん、俺が心配されてる場合じゃないよな。", "zh": "没事，没事的！……那个，谢谢你。\n嗯，现在可不是让人担心我的时候啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "e9eacd90b3f3cffc0297d6d17688e0c67bc239a1dbc8f3705c95e089c77c7f9e", "ja": "俺がアイドルを信じなくてどうする……。\nよし、麗花たちなら絶対できる！　頼んだぞ！", "zh": "我不相信偶像的话，还能怎么办……。\n好，丽花她们绝对能做到！拜托你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "95a0876857f80f64a2042fddde2e27408a0718a916fa59abec08cc0bf1152d7f", "ja": "はーい♪　みんなでしっかり準備して、\n登竜門をばびゅーんと通り抜けちゃいますね！", "zh": "好——♪ 大家一起好好准备，\n然后“嗖”地一下通过登龙门吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "c09c6f45a103d3175d4673831fc4c3b281d51d9eaedc602bf9790accde0e1620", "ja": "ばびゅ？　……まあ、その意気だ！\nでも麗花こそ、実は不安だったりしないか？", "zh": "“嗖——”？……不过，有这股干劲就好！但丽花你，其实是不是也有点不安？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "1ba3415adb715838187e1afe8d4d4e145a92b19d4f0e3a3b076e7524b5ca7e22", "ja": "……？\n私、実は不安そうに見えました？", "zh": "……？\n我看起来其实很不安吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "f4fda21a51c1daa9a3a94823e4434ef21de17b4894e31ef90c92bfdbd2fa09a0", "ja": "いいや、見えないよ。ただ、もし不安でも、\n麗花は表に出さないと思ったから。一応な。", "zh": "没有，看不出来。只是我觉得就算感到不安，\n丽花也不会表露出来。就只是以防万一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "3ea2c1549689e77884c89a8de8df5eecc92c180eb32e2ff0e37080bbfee4e8c5", "ja": "ふふっ。プロデューサーさんは心配性なんですね。\n心配デュ―サーさん♪", "zh": "呵呵，制作人先生真爱操心呢。\n爱操心制作人先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "355a72283d8367c1003f4f1d503eff43ea35df5649e34e9873bc9dda2d6ebcbb", "ja": "……だよな。\nごめん、余計な気を回しちゃって。", "zh": "……是啊。抱歉，是我多操心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "59512ae13af507a41a7a51c8ec7307d5bca9aa7a95a4ec16b5887ffa94027dfd", "ja": "いいえ、私もバッチリ不安なので、\n心配してもらえてよかったです♪", "zh": "不会，其实我也特别不安，\n能得到您的关心真是太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "e4d5860a7fb4759bdd1520e39a266d909e00aaf33029737ec3d152ab045fd538", "ja": "うん、ならいいん……え、やっぱり不安なの？？", "zh": "嗯，那就好……诶，你果然还是感到不安吗？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "25bf929b539a2eb4e7be033ab81bfbf0a1d1d7b50ce1bd55a0ceef8b29f863f9", "ja": "はい、それはもう！　ステージできちんとできるか、\n不安でドキドキバクバクです♪", "zh": "是的，那当然！不知道能不能在舞台上好好表现，紧张得心里怦怦直跳♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "41d8090b144c01a902b7b0029f335d14f294e8ddbb83f1cdc4ea1fcce8c0fbb9", "ja": "そうなんだ……。\nでも、楽しそうだよね？", "zh": "这样啊……  \n不过，看起来很开心，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "a9d1e3eac31f4d986a0e9b6d3040e9ef5c80cecea3b5c6906e18e8c9907df0d6", "ja": "楽しいですよ♪　ドキドキバクバクしていても、\nとっても嬉しくて楽しいんです。", "zh": "很开心哦♪　就算紧张得心怦怦直跳，也还是觉得特别开心、特别快乐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "a2604a0750835c44b4bae360eacc777a8d99fe099d9e5a5568f5f29e360578ac", "ja": "歌もダンスもステージも、\nたくさん期待してもらえて、応援してもらえて……。", "zh": "无论是歌曲、舞蹈还是舞台，\n都能得到大家满满的期待和支持……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1029_048rei", "source_sha256": "3c455e3c71dbce3d8114b47ccb42f5a33480b1cc199c7279917326482ab72d06", "ja": "アイドルになってからの毎日は、まるで雨上がりの\n空みたいにキラキラしてますから♪", "zh": "成为偶像后的每一天，都像雨后的天空一样闪闪发光♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1030_401pro", "source_sha256": "a4ec09589d2d52669b04c34bf0d767a5516e0f781c3fa3a471fdc292e884b395", "ja": "……そっか。\n充実してるんだな。", "zh": "……这样啊。\n过得很充实呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "df5c415e55d6dea166476b6308508a48d43e86949f6b0471705a3cceaa925263", "ja": "そうですね。毎日をドキドキバクバク、ときめきながら\n走り抜けて、いつか虹にも手が届くように……。", "zh": "是啊。每天都怀着激动与心跳，心潮澎湃地一路奔跑，希望有一天能触碰到彩虹……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1032_048rei", "source_sha256": "0e7d26bb7ed9da91a2e2867407ce34d7b6da73fed46c2f93d4d15bc9a270b6cc", "ja": "プロデューサーさん。\n手伝ってもらえますか？", "zh": "制作人。\n可以帮我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1033_401pro", "source_sha256": "9dbdbb802c816bd4ac05098782915f11b3a442fddd29d99638b73c9718974d5c", "ja": "もちろん。みんなで一緒に手を伸ばそう。\nその大きな虹に向かって……伸ばし続けような！", "zh": "当然了。大家一起伸出手吧。\n朝着那道巨大的彩虹……一直伸过去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_01_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "681b1db7ce4596a4aec40f3333fa7af62132337ad1d11dc8b982bb8305846c15", "ja": "はい！　空に手が届くまで、どこまでも。\n約束ですからね♪", "zh": "好的！在手能够到天空之前，无论多远都要继续下去。\n因为这是约定哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
